    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/extras/1050a391f0b6b352b29ecd41aeffe849.avif?t=1754871367\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens are attacking Earth. You pilot a ship built out of nanobots that can evolve to defeat anything that the invaders can throw at you. Defeat the waves of alien ships and push the war all the way back to their home world to ensure the safety of the human race.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based ship movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage power between shields and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your shields to defend against incoming fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect nanobots dropped by enemies to evolve your ship</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/extras/1050a391f0b6b352b29ecd41aeffe849.avif?t=1754871367\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens are attacking Earth. You pilot a ship built out of nanobots that can evolve to defeat anything that the invaders can throw at you. Defeat the waves of alien ships and push the war all the way back to their home world to ensure the safety of the human race.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based ship movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage power between shields and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your shields to defend against incoming fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect nanobots dropped by enemies to evolve your ship</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Nano Squadron is a top-down arena shooter roguelite where you pilot a spaceship made of nanobots that can evolve to fight off waves of alien ships. Build a ship that can best the invaders and save Earth.",
